
@startuml
title Banking Concurrency Simulator - Domain Model (Draft)

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho
hide empty methods

class BankAccount {
    - accountNumber: AccountNumber
    - balance: Money
    - overdraftLimit: Money
}

class AccountOwner {
    - ownerId: OwnerId
    - firstName: String
    - lastName: String
}

class Transaction {
    - transactionId: TransactionId
    - amount: Money
    - type: TransactionType
    - status: TransactionStatus
    - createdAt: Instant
}

class TransactionReservation {
    - transactionId: TransactionId
    - amount: Money
    - status: ReservationStatus
}

class TransactionHistory {
    + accountNumber: AccountNumber
}

class TransactionAuditLog {
}

enum TransactionType {
    ATM_WITHDRAWAL
    ATM_DEPOSIT
    ONLINE_TRANSFER
}

enum TransactionStatus {
    PENDING
    COMPLETED
    FAILED
    REJECTED
}

enum ReservationStatus {
    ACTIVE
    SETTLED
    RELEASED
}

BankAccount "0..*" -- "1..*" AccountOwner : owners
BankAccount "1" -- "0..*" TransactionReservation : reservations
BankAccount "1" -- "0..*" Transaction : operations

Transaction "1" -- "0..1" TransactionReservation : reservation

Transaction --> TransactionType
Transaction --> TransactionStatus
TransactionReservation --> ReservationStatus

TransactionHistory ..> Transaction : reads
TransactionAuditLog ..> Transaction : records attempts

note right of BankAccount
  Account balance and overdraft
  are independent of transaction history.

  Available funds =
    balance
    + overdraftLimit
    - active reservations
end note

note bottom of TransactionHistory
  Conceptual responsibility.
  Not necessarily a domain entity.
end note

note bottom of TransactionAuditLog
  Internal records, including
  rejected transaction attempts.
  Not exposed to customers.
end note

@enduml
